docs {
**Access:** Admin (bearer)

**Request body** `ShippingZoneCreate`:
  - `name`: string (required)
  - `description`: string|null
  - `is_active`: boolean
  - `sort_order`: integer
  - `dim_divisor`: number|null
  - `country_codes`: array[string]

**Responses:** 201, 422
}
